'''Tanky''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and can be unlocked as a daily stamp during the [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 278
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Tanky
|name2 = Tanky 'n' Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tanky 'n' Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Tanky is a Cat that, despite being called Tanky, is not tanky at all. Despite both form's descriptions, neither form is great for long-distance combat. Considering everything, Tanky is best used as an early-game ranger, most ideal for assassinating [[Hippoe]]s and [[Gory|Gories]], assuming you have decently leveled meatshields. Outside of killing early-game threats, Tanky best supports your Cat Army by contributing to your [[User Rank]], as he will hardly even scratch dangerous mid-game and late-game enemies.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

